<title>USA: Outlook Group names financial chief.</title>
<headline>Outlook Group names financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>MENASHA, Wis. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Outlook Group Corp said Tuesday it named Thomas Aschenbrenner as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Aschenbrenner replaces Larry Driscoll, who left the company in March.</p>
<p>Aschenbrenner most recently served as vice president and chief financial officer for Xymox Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
